} SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1fbac64a-de1c-4edb-b96c-4f285851bd36\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df1902e2-b78c-4416-86cd-6d6d5aa91a74\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4e98a5c-a3bb-4343-b3f2-8a08de031aab\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2364db24-1c43-409e-afe7-f5ba9d12c9c1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-278ef305-0d35-4a2e-9e61-e29e7a0c82f1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9debf584-7359-4de3-af10-158519277f1f\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-db42dca9-b977-40f2-bc18-ba039e3e283c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b273f5de-5e06-4a83-bb67-7ff48857a377\"><b>📢 7월 18일(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-46c95ed7-b15e-4d01-99cb-306355f41b5d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eea4f284-8438-44a2-8538-463849f0e46f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8b025851-0dfe-463b-ac12-0ad17a1568c0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9df6cfcb-f8eb-4872-b7ac-2573c681ea0c\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed4122d8-8afd-4331-bfea-7f1d48554956\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e2a4ce5b-2fc4-4435-910c-3a0d8dc1fc97\">- 7/18(금) 19:30 ~ 21:30 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9472f9af-5714-4ead-b117-5b13577cdad2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-28bec43c-fe80-4d57-bb36-c73f89be6891\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-223a74b6-778a-4d14-9654-309d959af3f1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-da5496fd-dae2-4806-852f-497c6d626c4b\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cbd76206-6c4a-427a-85d2-a9eef94b21aa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0cd3eeaa-10b1-450b-9de7-1c7a262bbf5f\">1. iOS 환경에서 OVER THE HORIZON 라이브 월페이퍼가 비정상적으로 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c7630369-ff0c-4afd-8f22-a19c8479674f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9f505c06-d1c4-45e0-ae33-eff98b484cf7\">2. 이상 개체 요격전의 크라켄과 전투 중 특정 상황에서 숨겨진 코어를 공격할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3eb10ab-ec3a-42ba-82af-2691abedbef8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-770ba67c-8851-4035-859c-461427d63f06\">3. 율리아의 애장품 스킬 레벨업 시 캐릭터의 속성과 다른 풍압 코드 매뉴얼이 사용되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5191cea2-0c1b-4f96-a499-08db8bda8be9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d0909352-d9fd-46e6-869f-7faf49dcbec9\">4. 업데이트 이후 소라의 상담 도감 진행도가 초기화된 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-584d041b-46de-4c43-9116-9d0265c080d0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f2009117-23fa-46f0-bc39-2383f5b59c8a\">  └ 업데이트 이전 상담 도감 진행도로 복구됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-71ae7362-1fee-4860-82a0-a9d5f1fbaf3c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ce33c1ae-9c77-49d6-a74f-7b444efa7777\">  └ 소라 상담하기 시 에러 메시지가 출력될 경우, 게임을 종료하신 후 재접속하여 주시기를 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f1e05c7f-b706-46b5-865c-f7ef98a882f9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c43ac881-43ce-4a41-8c53-48415122416a\">5. 베이 버스트 스킬 사용 시, 특정 상황에서 애장품 스킬1 「유 캔 두잇」과 애장품 스킬2 「치얼업 투게더」의 일부 효과가 적용되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4c854ba8-a6aa-417c-9b7b-b93c4f4dd670\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-59c4523d-632c-4cfb-a3a1-14d08bc1609e\">6. Google Play 게임즈 버전의 Launcher가 업데이트 되었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75b5baa3-2b73-4fb7-befd-be76b95ad6d4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2cc679b3-f6cc-48ae-bad9-e630b63d2820\">     Google Play 게임즈 환경에서 간헐적으로 결제가 진행되지 않는 문제가 복구되었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-02d26b68-07f4-4eea-8ffa-74b11a839876\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-515a636f-0374-4d5c-98fa-4c53484759ee\">  └ 결제가 이루어지지 않을 경우 Google Play 게임즈 환경의 게임과 Launcher를 종료하신 후 다시 접속해 주세요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-93aa879f-c8c1-4b01-9f5a-dadfb139b66f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b62cbef4-d7c1-4591-8271-ab297b033018\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3d079619-1d6f-433c-bfde-c91c60f75682\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-309a6858-f0b8-41a8-b369-92a2ec4a161c\"><b>🎁 보상</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a9e5067e-b4de-435b-abe4-5d354ba8206b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6783e388-375d-4c10-95c6-5635d4666fab\">- 300 쥬얼</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d781b5ba-2fd9-4d45-91a3-e135b87da875\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dabe9774-f195-485f-ab8c-ca870f1b3ef8\">- 파란 하늘 사진 * 2</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d5b6e551-086e-4b73-847a-38d7a15d71dd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e86508f2-29ef-472a-887c-11be8b475aff\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-182df842-732b-46af-aa49-8edc7d40817c\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5d8e1d5c-3ab7-4ef2-a561-1f5e2270d6ab\">※ 보상은 계정당 1회 지급되며, 네트워크 지연 등으로 인해 지급이 지연될 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8a280065-53f1-47dc-9753-65241095a7d1\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b6686b1f-67b6-4e95-89b5-8b0a4afd7178\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-898ebb41-f013-42db-8e53-1619327e6fba\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-663534fd-6c52-4634-bb5e-fd962ca3102c\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-81777295-5b14-449c-b7fc-e331ac3d3e72\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-680d1fba-b17f-4cab-824e-d51b68c11c5b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce3e15f7-967b-4d9f-b26b-a3094d46f639\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df8e2ed8-1e23-455c-8599-a2f082624cb5\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-c1873c19-e279-4b75-909a-0c1063f993de\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a7a051f3-1d0c-4c60-b381-e11d669ce58a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" clas